---
// Page backdrop for the gallery pages: a slow-drifting mesh gradient (clay, sage, sand) under a fine
// paper grain, fixed behind the page. Wraps the page so its layers sit under the content, not the body.
---

<div class="relative isolate">
  <div class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="mesh-blob top-[-20%] right-[-15%] size-[70vmax] bg-clay/90"></div>
    <div class="mesh-blob bottom-[-25%] left-[-20%] size-[65vmax] bg-[#9fb3ae]/80 [animation-delay:-8s]"></div>
    <div class="mesh-blob top-[30%] left-[35%] size-[45vmax] bg-sand/70 [animation-delay:-16s]"></div>
    <div class="paper-grain absolute inset-0"></div>
  </div>
  <slot />
</div>
